This product includes software developed as part of the vireSpace platform
(https://github.com/pruffit/vire).

Built on VireGlass (https://github.com/pruffit/vireglass). The Oklab color-mixing math
implements the model published by Björn Ottosson (https://bottosson.github.io/posts/oklab/).
The MacCormack advection scheme implements the method described in Selle, Fedkiw, Kim, Liu and
Rossignac, "An Unconditionally Stable MacCormack Method" (2007). No third-party code or assets
are included in or distributed with this software; these are citations, not redistribution.
